rule c1: C1 lists a block's locals by the name hash C1XX uses, so at /Od their frame slots follow the hash buckets, not the declaration (value 1, width 2, count 5, total 7, index 12, height 13)
cl /Od
frame= _f
  _count$ = -12
  _total$ = -16
  _index$ = -20
  _value$ = -4
  _width$ = -8
  _height$ = -24
